<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A service by the name of the “Parliamentary Service” is established and shall constitute a separate service from the public service under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
