<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Meetings of the Parliamentary Service Council shall be co-chaired by the President of the Senate and the Speaker of the House of Representatives."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
