<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The quorum of the Parliamentary Service Council shall be seven."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
