<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "All questions raised in the meetings of the Parliamentary Service Council shall be decided by the votes of the majority of members present and voting, and if the number of votes are equal, then the Chairman shall have the casting vote."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
