<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Parliamentary Service Council may determine its own procedure."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
