<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Parliamentary Service Council may establish any committee as the Parliamentary Service Council considers necessary or expedient to assist the Parliamentary Service Council in the performance of its functions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
