<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Parliamentary Service Council may appoint any member of the Parliamentary Service to be a member of any committee established under subsection (1)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
