<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
