<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A disclosure under subsection (3) shall be recorded in the minutes of the meeting in which the disclosure was made and, after the disclosure, the member of the Parliamentary Service Disciplinary Committee shall not be present and take part in the deliberation or decision of the Parliamentary Service Disciplinary Committee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Meetings of the Parliamentary Service Disciplinary Committee shall be co-chaired by the Deputy President of the Senate and the Deputy Speaker of the House of Representatives."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
