<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Every member of the Parliamentary Service Disciplinary Committee present at the meeting shall be entitled to one vote."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
