<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_VI__cl_16> <https://schema.org/text> "The Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 [Act 198] shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceedings against any member of the Parliamentary Service Council, Parliamentary Service Promotion Committee, Parliamentary Service Disciplinary Committee, Parliamentary Service Appeal Committee, committee established under this Act, or any member of the Parliamentary Service, in respect of any act or thing done or committed by him in such capacity. Public servant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
