<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Administrator of Parliament shall perform such other duties as the Parliamentary Service Council may direct."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
