<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "In discharging his duties, the Chief Administrator of Parliament shall act under the general authority and directions of the Parliamentary Service Council."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
