<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Administrator of Parliament shall be the secretary to the Parliamentary Service Council. Fund"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_12> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
