<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_12> <https://schema.org/text> "The Government shall provide sufficient funds for the Parliamentary Service annually to enable the Parliamentary Service Council to perform its functions under this Act. Remuneration"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/4/eng@> .
